{"id":30920102,"desc":"己方释放至终的仪式时，伊戈尔可获得<span class=\"color-value\">2</span>点激情<br>当队友兽灵感数量为<span class=\"color-value\">1/2</span>名及以上时，{{s|未逝的昏冥}}赋予主目标的{{s|弹壳碎片<id:2>}}额外增加<span class=\"color-value\">3/5</span>层；友方单体攻击时，额外赋予目标<span class=\"color-value\">1/2</span>层{{s|弹壳碎片<id:2>}}，释放至终的仪式时，赋予敌方全体<span class=\"color-value\">3/5</span>层{{s|弹壳碎片<id:2>}}；<br>若队伍中存在洛佩拉，则洛佩拉额外获得<span class=\"color-value\">50%</span>暴击创伤，并使洛佩拉在攻击前赋予目标<span class=\"color-value\">6</span>层燃烧，洛佩拉释放仪式时，分别给自身前方/后方的友方角色分发<span class=\"color-value\">1</span>层{{s|仪式子弹<id:1>}}/{{s|术法子弹<id:1>}}<br>若队伍中存在莫莉德尔，则莫莉德尔和伊戈尔溢出的激情会被临时储存，回合结束时若该角色激情空余时补充，每个角色最多储存<span class=\"color-value\">5</span>点激情；莫莉德尔释放仪式后，可使莫莉德尔激情<span class=\"color-value\">+1</span>，伊戈尔激情<span class=\"color-value\">+2</span>，并额外赋予敌方全体<span class=\"color-value\">12</span>层{{s|弹壳碎片<id:2>}}","type":1,"isBigSkill":0,"needExPoint":0,"skillEffectType":0,"isExtra":0,"clientIgnoreCondition":"","powerCost":"","bigSkillPoint":0,"targetLimit":0,"showTag":0,"effectTag":0,"resistancesTag":"","damageRate":0,"logicTarget":"","condition1":"25212","conditionTarget1":"101","behavior1":"20002#2","behaviorTarget1":"103","limit1":0,"roundLimit1":0,"condition2":"516101#4#3#2#1","conditionTarget2":"103","behavior2":"1#30920206","behaviorTarget2":"103","limit2":0,"roundLimit2":0,"condition3":"516101#4#1#3#1","conditionTarget3":"103","behavior3":"1#30920207","behaviorTarget3":"103","limit3":0,"roundLimit3":0,"condition4":"5","conditionTarget4":"103","behavior4":"1#30920201","behaviorTarget4":"103","limit4":0,"roundLimit4":0,"condition5":"5","conditionTarget5":"103","behavior5":"1#30920205","behaviorTarget5":"103","limit5":0,"roundLimit5":0,"condition6":"595101#3121","conditionTarget6":"101","behavior6":"1#30920104","behaviorTarget6":"103","limit6":0,"roundLimit6":0,"condition7":"595101#3121","conditionTarget7":"101","behavior7":"1#30920222","behaviorTarget7":"103","limit7":0,"roundLimit7":0,"condition8":"516101#4#3#2#1","conditionTarget8":"103","behavior8":"